{'symbol': 'TFX', 'date': '2021-07-29 06:45:00', 'title': 'TELEFLEX ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "WAYNE, PA., JULY 29, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TELEFLEX INCORPORATED (NYSE:TFX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF THIRTY-FOUR CENTS ($0.34) PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE SEPTEMBER 15, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON AUGUST 16, 2021. ADDITIONAL INFORMATION ABOUT TELEFLEX CAN BE OBTAINED FROM THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE AT TELEFLEX.COM ."}{'symbol': 'TFX', 'date': '2021-07-29 06:30:00', 'title': 'TELEFLEX REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2021 RESULTS AND FULL YEAR OUTLOOK', 'text': 'WAYNE, PA., JULY 29, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TELEFLEX INCORPORATED (NYSE: TFX) (THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE SECOND QUARTER ENDED JUNE\xa027, 2021.'}